{"id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-jump.md","title":"跳跃的严格性、单调性与枚举完全性","display":"thm-jump — 跳跃的严格性、单调性与枚举完全性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-jump","aliases":["20-thm-jump"],"display":"thm-jump — 跳跃的严格性、单调性与枚举完全性","chapter":"3","section":"3.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 3.4.3","source_pdf_pages":[97,98],"source_printed_pages":[61,62],"depends_on":["[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-relative-ce]]","[[20-df-tred]]","[[20-df-one-reduction]]","[[20-thm-relative-smn]]","[[20-thm-relative-complement]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-jump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-jump — 跳跃的严格性、单调性与枚举完全性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 3.4.3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>97</span><span>98</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>61</span><span>62</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6134451906e575\" href=\"?note=8b6134451906e575\" title=\"20-thm-relative-smn\">20-thm-relative-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e8b39213fac999be\" href=\"?note=e8b39213fac999be\" title=\"20-thm-relative-complement\">20-thm-relative-complement</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B,C\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_1\">\\(\\le_1\\)</span> 的见证是普通全可计算单射。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8b6134451906e575\" href=\"?note=8b6134451906e575\" title=\"20-thm-relative-smn\">20-thm-relative-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e8b39213fac999be\" href=\"?note=e8b39213fac999be\" title=\"20-thm-relative-complement\">20-thm-relative-complement</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\le_TA&#39;,\\qquad A&#39;\\not\\le_TA,\\qquad A&#39;\\in\\mathcal E^A,\\\\\nC\\in\\mathcal E^A\\Longleftrightarrow C\\le_1A&#39;,\\\\\nB\\le_TA\\Longleftrightarrow B&#39;\\le_1A&#39;,\\\\\nA\\le_TB\\Rightarrow A&#39;\\le_TB&#39;,\\qquad A\\equiv_TB\\Rightarrow A&#39;\\equiv_1B&#39;.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\le_TA&#39;,\\qquad A&#39;\\not\\le_TA,\\qquad A&#39;\\in\\mathcal E^A,\\\\\nC\\in\\mathcal E^A\\Longleftrightarrow C\\le_1A&#39;,\\\\\nB\\le_TA\\Longleftrightarrow B&#39;\\le_1A&#39;,\\\\\nA\\le_TB\\Rightarrow A&#39;\\le_TB&#39;,\\qquad A\\equiv_TB\\Rightarrow A&#39;\\equiv_1B&#39;.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>跳跃 c.e. 性由并行模拟所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A(e)\">\\(\\Phi_e^A(e)\\)</span> 得到。若某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 程序能判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\)</span>，编译“在自身不停止时停止、在自身停止时发散”的对角程序，代入其自身索引即矛盾，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\\not\\le_TA\">\\(A&#39;\\not\\le_TA\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=W_e^A\">\\(C=W_e^A\\)</span>，把“忽略自身输入，运行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A(x)\">\\(\\Phi_e^A(x)\\)</span>”用相对 s-m-n 单射编译为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(e,x)\">\\(h(e,x)\\)</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in C\\iff h(e,x)\\in A&#39;\">\\(x\\in C\\iff h(e,x)\\in A&#39;\\)</span>；编译器不读取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 后仍为普通全可计算单射。反向，把一一归约见证代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>-枚举半判定器，便得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathcal E^A\">\\(C\\in\\mathcal E^A\\)</span>。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 与补集都可枚举于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，所以都一一可约于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\)</span>，给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_TA&#39;\">\\(A\\le_TA&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\le_TA\">\\(B\\le_TA\\)</span>，可用给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 归约逐步模拟 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> oracle，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B&#39;\\in\\mathcal E^A\">\\(B&#39;\\in\\mathcal E^A\\)</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B&#39;\\le_1A&#39;\">\\(B&#39;\\le_1A&#39;\\)</span>。反向，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 和补集均一一可约于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B&#39;\">\\(B&#39;\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B&#39;\\le_1A&#39;\">\\(B&#39;\\le_1A&#39;\\)</span>，复合后两者都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E^A\">\\(\\mathcal E^A\\)</span>，相对补集定理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\le_TA\">\\(B\\le_TA\\)</span>。互换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 给等价结论。这里的反射结论使用一一归约；不把它偷换成“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B&#39;\\le_TA&#39;\">\\(B&#39;\\le_TA&#39;\\)</span> 反映 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\le_TA\">\\(B\\le_TA\\)</span>”。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 3.4.3(i)–(vi)；印刷 61–62 / PDF 97–98。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-relative-ce","status":"resolved","id":"2c15e9656c322806","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-relative-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tred